{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124479","id":4860830105,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIbphmQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124479","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124479.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124479.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124479","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124479/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124479/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124479/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e6cad976f88169c9394c2d02b304877dc45fd1bb","number":124479,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Change tiling mode in line3d for consistency with 2d","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\nLine3D has a naming discrepancy with Line2D. Possibly a non-problem.\n\n### Line2D\n\n<img width=\"598\" height=\"446\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a9658adc-5984-44e9-a883-c1429af10963\" />\n\n### Line3D\n\n<img width=\"605\" height=\"325\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d41abb6-77cc-48f8-8def-f2da1738a3e1\" />\n\n\n## Additional information\n\nI'm not sure how much we care about 2d and 3d consistency in naming, my instinct tells me we care at least a bit.\n\nLine2D's enums are all preceded by Line<etc> while Line3D aren't. I am not sure what's the naming policy on that, and if the enums should change name to be of the form Line<etc> for example LineMaterialMode instead of MaterialMode.\n\nAdditionally, perhaps tiling mode should change to texture mode as well? It may be more intuitive, but i suspect we'd get users asking \"where do i assign a texture\" if we call it TextureMode instead of tiling mode.\n\nThis change only change the enum names since I think that the 2d ones are a bit more clear than the 3d ones. ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.